<div class=Section1>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='color:maroon;
background:silver;mso-highlight:silver'>PcGK Not</span></i></b><i
style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='color:maroon;background:silver;
mso-highlight:silver'>: TEV Hesaplanmasında kullanılacak <span
style='mso-text-animation:blink-background'>AB'nin üçüncü ülkelere uyguladığı
vergi oranın tespitinde</span></span><span style='color:black;background:silver;
mso-highlight:silver'> </span><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='color:red;background:silver;mso-highlight:silver'>TARIC <a
target='_blank' href="https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/taric/taric_consultation.jsp?Lang=tr&SimDate=20190516">için
TIKLAYIN</a> </span></b><span style='color:maroon;background:silver;mso-highlight:
silver'>linkini kullanabilirsiniz.</span><span style='color:maroon'><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt'><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-family:Tahoma;background:silver;mso-highlight:silver;mso-no-proof:
yes'>Danıştay Kararları<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>          </span></span></i><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:
